# Build context for ./Dockerfile (B-32).
#
# The Dockerfile only ever COPYs from backend/, so this is an allow-list: exclude
# everything at the root, then add backend/ back. That keeps node_modules/, .git/,
# apps/, assets/ and .env.local out of the context entirely — the context went from
# the whole monorepo to just the .NET sources.
#
# If the Dockerfile ever needs another path, re-include it here with a `!` line;
# otherwise the COPY fails with "file not found" even though the file is committed.
*

!backend/

# .NET build output from local `dotnet build` / `dotnet test` runs. Leaving these in
# makes the image build pick up host artifacts instead of restoring cleanly, and on
# Windows hosts they can carry locked or wrong-RID DLLs.
backend/**/bin/
backend/**/obj/
backend/**/TestResults/

# Local-only configuration never belongs in an image.
backend/**/appsettings.*.local.json
backend/**/*.user
